OL,3,GNEWSAParking concerns over new
OL,4,Aresidential cycle spine
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents say they are worried about
OL,7,Fthe new section of a 26-mile cycle path
OL,8,Fthat will run through a residential
OL,9,Farea due to fears parking spaces and
OL,10,Feasy access to their homes will be
OL,11,Flost.
OL,13,FGloucestershire County Council is in
OL,14,Fthe process of creating what transport
OL,15,Fchiefs say will be a "gamechanging"
OL,16,Fcycle spine linking Bishop's Cleeve
OL,17,Fwith Stroud via Cheltenham and
OL,18,FGloucester, with the latest section
OL,19,Frunning through Linden, Podsmead, and
OL,20,FTuffley.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
