OL,3,GNEWSAParking concerns over new
OL,4,Aresidential cycle spine
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunity activist Sophie Wootton-Lee
OL,7,Fis among those concerned.
OL,9,FShe said: "Everyone who lives around
OL,10,Fhere will have driven round and round
OL,11,Fat some point, looking for a parking
OL,12,Fspace. The removal of on-street parking
OL,13,Fwill make this even worse."
